SELECT * FROM `otel_logs` WHERE (`ResourceAttributes`[?] = ?) AND (if(mapContains(mapConcat(`ResourceAttributes`, map(if(mapContains(`ResourceAttributes`, ?), ?, ?), CAST(arrayReverse(arrayFold((__json_seen, __json_entry) -> if(has(arrayMap(__json_seen_entry -> tupleElement(__json_seen_entry, ?), __json_seen), tupleElement(__json_entry, ?)), __json_seen, arrayPushBack(__json_seen, __json_entry)), arrayReverse(CAST(extractKeyValuePairs(`Body`, ?, ?, ?), ?)), CAST(array(), ?))), ?)[?])), ?), mapConcat(`ResourceAttributes`, map(if(mapContains(`ResourceAttributes`, ?), ?, ?), CAST(arrayReverse(arrayFold((__json_seen, __json_entry) -> if(has(arrayMap(__json_seen_entry -> tupleElement(__json_seen_entry, ?), __json_seen), tupleElement(__json_entry, ?)), __json_seen, arrayPushBack(__json_seen, __json_entry)), arrayReverse(CAST(extractKeyValuePairs(`Body`, ?, ?, ?), ?)), CAST(array(), ?))), ?)[?]))[?], if(mapContains(`LogAttributes`, ?), `LogAttributes`[?], if(mapContains(`LogAttributes`, ?), `LogAttributes`[?], `LogAttributes`[?]))) = ?)
